{"id":"twitter:1851291401780174950","tweet_id":"1851291401780174950","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1851291401780174950","title":"@Billbrowder @MaxBlumenthal @RepEdRoyce At the same time that Putin's favorite Congressman was pushing the movie in DC other people were trying to get","summary":"@Billbrowder @MaxBlumenthal @RepEdRoyce At the same time that Putin's favorite Congressman was pushing the movie in DC other people were trying to get it screened at the European Parliament. Heidi Hautala ,another \"friend,\" has designs to screen the movie in the EU It was canceled at the last minute https://t.co/ag3tT3mPxw","date":"2024-10-29","published":"2024-10-29T15:54:00+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1851290031932985661","reply_tweet_id":"1851290031932985661","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@Billbrowder @MaxBlumenthal @RepEdRoyce At the same time that Putin&#x27;s favorite Congressman was pushing the movie in DC other people were trying to get it screened at the European Parliament.<br><br>Heidi Hautala ,another &quot;friend,&quot; has designs to screen the movie in the EU<br><br>It was canceled at the last minute <a href=\"https://t.co/ag3tT3mPxw\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/ag3tT3mPxw</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/26595792c88a1a63700dff5c567f3a01.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1851291401780174950","display_date":"October 29, 2024 · 15:54 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/26595792c88a1a63700dff5c567f3a01.jpg"]}
