{"id":"twitter:1850986872656576526","tweet_id":"1850986872656576526","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1850986872656576526","title":"@NYinLA2121 @TheRickWilson It was just two days ago. It takes more than a day for the FBI to investigate and then the DOJ to prosecute violations of S","summary":"@NYinLA2121 @TheRickWilson It was just two days ago. It takes more than a day for the FBI to investigate and then the DOJ to prosecute violations of Section 245(b)(1)(A) of Title 18 of the U.S. Code. I will go out on a limb and say both State and Federal Law enforcement opened investigations.","date":"2024-10-28","published":"2024-10-28T19:43:54+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/i/status/1850983042661400685","reply_tweet_id":"1850983042661400685","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@NYinLA2121 @TheRickWilson It was just two days ago. <br><br>It takes more than a day for the FBI to investigate and then the DOJ to prosecute violations of Section 245(b)(1)(A) of Title 18 of the U.S. Code.<br><br>I will go out on a limb and say both State and Federal Law enforcement opened investigations.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1850986872656576526","display_date":"October 28, 2024 · 19:43 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
