{"id":"twitter:1850942824038220006","tweet_id":"1850942824038220006","source":"twitter","type":"photos","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1850942824038220006","title":"In 2007 Trump tried to bring Trump Vodka to russia It failed, miserably Only place it sold was Israel, until everyone learned the Kosher Vodka was mad","summary":"In 2007 Trump tried to bring Trump Vodka to russia It failed, miserably Only place it sold was Israel, until everyone learned the Kosher Vodka was made with leavened products and it wasn't Kosher at all If you can't sell vodka to a russian, you suck at business https://t.co/0spg2Wt1lS","date":"2024-10-28","published":"2024-10-28T16:48:52+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>In 2007 Trump tried to bring Trump Vodka to russia<br><br>It failed, miserably<br><br>Only place it sold was Israel, until everyone learned the Kosher Vodka was made with leavened products<br><br>and it wasn&#x27;t Kosher at all<br><br>If you can&#x27;t sell vodka to a russian, you suck at business <a href=\"https://t.co/0spg2Wt1lS\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/0spg2Wt1lS</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/81506d18d4807e95372afcc18f3a47cd.png\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1850942824038220006","display_date":"October 28, 2024 · 16:48 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/81506d18d4807e95372afcc18f3a47cd.png"]}
