{"id":"twitter:1850870327384887327","tweet_id":"1850870327384887327","source":"twitter","type":"photos","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1850870327384887327","title":"Hey Catholics Correct me if I am wrong, but the Catechism specifically warns of millenialism, especially secular millenialism What's not in the Catech","summary":"Hey Catholics Correct me if I am wrong, but the Catechism specifically warns of millenialism, especially secular millenialism What's not in the Catechism? Abortion. That is 1983 Code of Canon Law then reaffirmed by Pope John Paul in 1992. https://t.co/zerOuhtFHn","date":"2024-10-28","published":"2024-10-28T12:00:48+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>Hey Catholics <br><br>Correct me if I am wrong, but the Catechism specifically warns of millenialism, especially secular millenialism<br><br>What&#x27;s not in the Catechism?<br><br>Abortion. <br><br>That is 1983 Code of Canon Law then reaffirmed by Pope John Paul in 1992. <a href=\"https://t.co/zerOuhtFHn\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/zerOuhtFHn</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/564357fb4150d6d7f9a4777c80b20221.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1850870327384887327","display_date":"October 28, 2024 · 12:00 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/564357fb4150d6d7f9a4777c80b20221.jpg"]}
