{"id":"twitter:1850862588805980638","tweet_id":"1850862588805980638","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1850862588805980638","title":"@EvanPower @GOP That's cool, Black guy with a thing on his head. What the hell is that, a lamp shade? Look at this guy! Oh, my goodness. Wow! I'm just","summary":"@EvanPower @GOP That's cool, Black guy with a thing on his head. What the hell is that, a lamp shade? Look at this guy! Oh, my goodness. Wow! I'm just kidding, that's one of my buddies. He had a Halloween party last night. We had fun, we carved watermelons together. It was awesome!\" The @GOP","date":"2024-10-28","published":"2024-10-28T11:30:03+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1850860944412258605","reply_tweet_id":"1850860944412258605","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@EvanPower @GOP That&#x27;s cool, Black guy with a thing on his head. What the hell is that, a  lamp shade? Look at this guy! Oh, my goodness. Wow! I&#x27;m just kidding,  that&#x27;s one of my buddies. He had a Halloween party last night. We had  fun, we carved watermelons together. It was awesome!&quot;<br><br>The @GOP</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1850862588805980638","display_date":"October 28, 2024 · 11:30 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1850860944412258605","tweet_id":"1850860944412258605","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1850860944412258605","title":"@EvanPower @GOP \"It's wild. And these Latinos, they love making babies too, just know that. They do, they do. There's no pulling out. They don't do th","summary":"@EvanPower @GOP \"It's wild. And these Latinos, they love making babies too, just know that. They do, they do. There's no pulling out. They don't do that. They come inside, just like they did to our country.\" This is your @GOP This is the playbook. Attack Black and Brown voters in Florida","date":"2024-10-28","published":"2024-10-28T11:23:31+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1850860719459258397","reply_tweet_id":"1850860719459258397","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@EvanPower @GOP &quot;It&#x27;s wild. And these Latinos, they love making babies too, just know  that. They do, they do. There&#x27;s no pulling out. They don&#x27;t do that. They  come inside, just like they did to our country.&quot;<br><br>This is your @GOP <br><br>This is the playbook. Attack Black and Brown voters in Florida</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1850860944412258605","display_date":"October 28, 2024 · 11:23 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
