{"id":"twitter:1849971902301045171","tweet_id":"1849971902301045171","source":"twitter","type":"photos","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1849971902301045171","title":"Do yourself a favor If you find yourself skipping though a lily field and come across an empty space and it trembles and explodes and a bus in its pla","summary":"Do yourself a favor If you find yourself skipping though a lily field and come across an empty space and it trembles and explodes and a bus in its place Make sure to get on. Always get on the bus https://t.co/prXkaFCaAU","date":"2024-10-26","published":"2024-10-26T00:30:46+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>Do yourself a favor<br><br>If you find yourself skipping though a lily field and come across an empty space<br><br>and it trembles and explodes and a bus in its place<br><br>Make sure to get on.<br><br>Always get on the bus <a href=\"https://t.co/prXkaFCaAU\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/prXkaFCaAU</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/f03437b56416660150cfea959fcecd48.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1849971902301045171","display_date":"October 26, 2024 · 00:30 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/f03437b56416660150cfea959fcecd48.jpg"]}
{"id":"twitter:1849969359264895244","tweet_id":"1849969359264895244","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1849969359264895244","title":"I remember an interview with Phil talking about the first time he met Trey and Page to get ready for the April 1999 shows He was amazed by the technic","summary":"I remember an interview with Phil talking about the first time he met Trey and Page to get ready for the April 1999 shows He was amazed by the technical practice, \"These guys would play for eight hours a day. I was in heaven\" ..a paraphrase but like that","date":"2024-10-26","published":"2024-10-26T00:20:40+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>I remember an interview with Phil talking about the first time he met Trey and Page to get ready for the April 1999 shows<br><br>He was amazed by the technical practice, &quot;These guys would play for eight hours a day. I was in heaven&quot; ..a paraphrase but like that</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1849969359264895244","display_date":"October 26, 2024 · 00:20 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1849968943563223181","tweet_id":"1849968943563223181","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1849968943563223181","title":"@LuciaMia23 Me too, for many of them, Phish was blowing up and these shows were more intimate And Phil got to lead bands but John Molo,Rob Barraco,War","summary":"@LuciaMia23 Me too, for many of them, Phish was blowing up and these shows were more intimate And Phil got to lead bands but John Molo,Rob Barraco,Warren Haynes, Jimmy Herring with other greats It was like getting to play with people who practiced and knew music and stuff","date":"2024-10-26","published":"2024-10-26T00:19:01+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/LuciaMia23/status/1849967756646531189","reply_tweet_id":"1849967756646531189","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@LuciaMia23 Me too, for many of them, Phish was blowing up and these shows were more intimate<br><br>And Phil got to lead bands but John Molo,Rob Barraco,Warren Haynes, Jimmy Herring<br><br>with other greats<br><br>It was like getting to play with people who practiced and knew music and stuff</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1849968943563223181","display_date":"October 26, 2024 · 00:19 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
