{"id":"twitter:1849938657458729035","tweet_id":"1849938657458729035","source":"twitter","type":"photos","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1849938657458729035","title":"It was for Janis, but she won't mind If you hear that same sweet song again Will you know why? Anyone who sings a tune so sweet Is passing by Laugh in","summary":"It was for Janis, but she won't mind If you hear that same sweet song again Will you know why? Anyone who sings a tune so sweet Is passing by Laugh in the sunshine Sing Cry in the dark Fly Through the night https://t.co/852ujQZxAu","date":"2024-10-25","published":"2024-10-25T22:18:40+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>It was for Janis, but she won&#x27;t mind<br><br>If you hear that same sweet song again<br>Will you know why?<br>Anyone who sings a tune so sweet<br>Is passing by<br><br>Laugh in the sunshine<br>Sing<br>Cry in the dark<br>Fly<br>Through the night <a href=\"https://t.co/852ujQZxAu\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/852ujQZxAu</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/ef8669c45a1dbe06294f32a1625b28be.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1849938657458729035","display_date":"October 25, 2024 · 22:18 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/ef8669c45a1dbe06294f32a1625b28be.jpg"]}
{"id":"twitter:1849938204528415186","tweet_id":"1849938204528415186","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1849938204528415186","title":"Kinda fits the times: Blue light rain, whoa unbroken chain, Looking for familiar faces in an empty window pane. Listening for the secret, searching fo","summary":"Kinda fits the times: Blue light rain, whoa unbroken chain, Looking for familiar faces in an empty window pane. Listening for the secret, searching for the sound But I could only hear the preacher and the baying of his hounds. Willow sky, whoa, I walk and wonder why, They say… https://x.com/phattskis/status/1849937698699841683","date":"2024-10-25","published":"2024-10-25T22:16:52+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>Kinda fits the times:<br><br>Blue light rain, whoa unbroken chain,<br>Looking for familiar faces in an empty window pane.<br><br>Listening for the secret, searching for the sound<br>But I could only hear the preacher and the baying of his hounds.<br><br>Willow sky, whoa, I walk and wonder why,<br>They say… <a href=\"https://x.com/phattskis/status/1849937698699841683\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://x.com/phattskis/status/1849937698699841683</a></p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1849938204528415186","display_date":"October 25, 2024 · 22:16 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1849933683681263712","tweet_id":"1849933683681263712","source":"twitter","type":"photos","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1849933683681263712","title":"There is a road, no simple highway Between the dawn and the dark of night And if you go, no one may follow That path is for your steps alone Ripple in","summary":"There is a road, no simple highway Between the dawn and the dark of night And if you go, no one may follow That path is for your steps alone Ripple in still water When there is no pebble tossed Nor wind to blow https://t.co/8wWO3TewGU","date":"2024-10-25","published":"2024-10-25T21:58:54+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>There is a road, no simple highway<br>Between the dawn and the dark of night<br>And if you go, no one may follow<br>That path is for your steps alone<br><br>Ripple in still water<br>When there is no pebble tossed<br>Nor wind to blow <a href=\"https://t.co/8wWO3TewGU\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/8wWO3TewGU</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/c70c6e65eed5a8895c2e7f1435fc0c23.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1849933683681263712","display_date":"October 25, 2024 · 21:58 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/c70c6e65eed5a8895c2e7f1435fc0c23.jpg"]}
{"id":"twitter:1849933017680081164","tweet_id":"1849933017680081164","source":"twitter","type":"photos","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1849933017680081164","title":"Walk into splintered sunlight Inch your way through dead dreams to another land Maybe you're tired and broken Your tongue is twisted with words half s","summary":"Walk into splintered sunlight Inch your way through dead dreams to another land Maybe you're tired and broken Your tongue is twisted with words half spoken And thoughts unclear What do you want me to do To do for you to see you through? A box of rain will ease the pain And love… https://t.co/6jYWUUGpqt","date":"2024-10-25","published":"2024-10-25T21:56:16+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>Walk into splintered sunlight<br>Inch your way through dead dreams to another land<br>Maybe you&#x27;re tired and broken<br>Your tongue is twisted with words half spoken<br>And thoughts unclear<br><br>What do you want me to do<br>To do for you to see you through?<br>A box of rain will ease the pain<br>And love… <a href=\"https://t.co/6jYWUUGpqt\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/6jYWUUGpqt</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/e2a5e26517c677e12b9fa798f714ee2a.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1849933017680081164","display_date":"October 25, 2024 · 21:56 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/e2a5e26517c677e12b9fa798f714ee2a.jpg"]}
{"id":"twitter:1849932269298876654","tweet_id":"1849932269298876654","source":"twitter","type":"photos","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1849932269298876654","title":"Going to plant a weeping willow On the banks green edge it will grow, grow, grow Sing a lullaby beside the water Lovers come and go, the river roll, r","summary":"Going to plant a weeping willow On the banks green edge it will grow, grow, grow Sing a lullaby beside the water Lovers come and go, the river roll, roll, roll Fare you well, fare you well I love you more than words can tell Listen to the river sing sweet songs To rock my soul https://t.co/NRnCOk83Re","date":"2024-10-25","published":"2024-10-25T21:53:17+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>Going to plant a weeping willow<br>On the banks green edge it will grow, grow, grow<br>Sing a lullaby beside the water<br>Lovers come and go, the river roll, roll, roll<br><br>Fare you well, fare you well<br>I love you more than words can tell<br>Listen to the river sing sweet songs<br>To rock my soul <a href=\"https://t.co/NRnCOk83Re\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/NRnCOk83Re</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/306d01d3fc6a7e5038f4c170cccee5ad.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1849932269298876654","display_date":"October 25, 2024 · 21:53 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/306d01d3fc6a7e5038f4c170cccee5ad.jpg"]}
