{"id":"twitter:1849902566123110893","tweet_id":"1849902566123110893","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1849902566123110893","title":"After college we flew out to the Warfield for the Phil and Friends show with Page and Trey. Had 1 out of three tickets I was working at a stagehand at","summary":"After college we flew out to the Warfield for the Phil and Friends show with Page and Trey. Had 1 out of three tickets I was working at a stagehand at the time. I went to Kinkos and photocopied my pass from Hartford It worked both nights Thanks for the memories, Phil","date":"2024-10-25","published":"2024-10-25T19:55:15+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>After college we flew out to the Warfield for the Phil and Friends show with Page and Trey.<br><br>Had 1 out of three tickets<br><br>I was working at a stagehand at the time. I went to Kinkos and photocopied my pass from Hartford<br><br>It worked both nights<br><br>Thanks for the memories, Phil</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1849902566123110893","display_date":"October 25, 2024 · 19:55 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
