{"id":"twitter:1848733713862980083","tweet_id":"1848733713862980083","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1848733713862980083","title":"It's just one day of IPEV, but Florida is in play. Check my math @PatriotKisses @whitfox https://x.com/jgmac1106/status/1848733231165620297","summary":"It's just one day of IPEV, but Florida is in play. Check my math @PatriotKisses @whitfox https://x.com/jgmac1106/status/1848733231165620297","date":"2024-10-22","published":"2024-10-22T14:30:39+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>It&#x27;s just one day of IPEV, but Florida is in play.<br><br>Check my math @PatriotKisses @whitfox <a href=\"https://x.com/jgmac1106/status/1848733231165620297\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://x.com/jgmac1106/status/1848733231165620297</a></p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1848733713862980083","display_date":"October 22, 2024 · 14:30 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1848733231165620297","tweet_id":"1848733231165620297","source":"twitter","type":"photos","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1848733231165620297","title":"Let's do Math with Florida Assume 8% of GOP break for Harris and 54% of NPA. Low estimates 54,551.2 is eight percent of 681,890 That's 627, 338 for Tr","summary":"Let's do Math with Florida Assume 8% of GOP break for Harris and 54% of NPA. Low estimates 54,551.2 is eight percent of 681,890 That's 627, 338 for Trump and 721,113 for Harris 54% of NPA = 184,001 That's 905,114 Harris and 784,089 Trump Check my work @cbouzy @EvanPower https://t.co/Vn3aJ0u2Co","date":"2024-10-22","published":"2024-10-22T14:28:44+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>Let&#x27;s do Math with Florida<br><br>Assume 8% of GOP break for Harris and 54% of NPA. Low estimates<br><br>54,551.2 is eight percent of 681,890<br><br>That&#x27;s 627, 338 for Trump and 721,113 for Harris<br><br>54% of NPA = 184,001<br><br>That&#x27;s 905,114 Harris and 784,089 Trump<br><br>Check my work @cbouzy @EvanPower <a href=\"https://t.co/Vn3aJ0u2Co\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/Vn3aJ0u2Co</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/3812a27300e9e94c343999f2bbdaf325.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1848733231165620297","display_date":"October 22, 2024 · 14:28 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/3812a27300e9e94c343999f2bbdaf325.jpg"]}
