{"id":"twitter:1848703723800850613","tweet_id":"1848703723800850613","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1848703723800850613","title":"@poppaskeeter @cbouzy No I am not I am doing mathematical analysis using tharly vote turn outs, 54% NPA breaking for Biden, and 3-5% of GOP breaking f","summary":"@poppaskeeter @cbouzy No I am not I am doing mathematical analysis using tharly vote turn outs, 54% NPA breaking for Biden, and 3-5% of GOP breaking for Kamala Harris If you used those brackets and then modeled based on the today's early turn out, a fools errand, Trump loses Estimations aren't cope","date":"2024-10-22","published":"2024-10-22T12:31:29+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/z_anon11/status/1848702134084128917","reply_tweet_id":"1848702134084128917","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@poppaskeeter @cbouzy No I am not<br><br>I am doing mathematical analysis using tharly vote turn outs, 54% NPA breaking for Biden, and 3-5% of GOP breaking for Kamala Harris<br><br>If you used those brackets and then modeled based on the today&#x27;s early turn out, a fools errand, Trump loses<br><br>Estimations aren&#x27;t cope</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1848703723800850613","display_date":"October 22, 2024 · 12:31 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
