{"id":"twitter:1848542519790821629","tweet_id":"1848542519790821629","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1848542519790821629","title":"just put together a fun history fact @RacheGabriel So Jean Chall's (technically my academic grandma) revised Learning to Read the Great Debate (1967) ","summary":"just put together a fun history fact @RacheGabriel So Jean Chall's (technically my academic grandma) revised Learning to Read the Great Debate (1967) was updated in 1983. In 1984 the Council for National Policy did a phonics demo after their keynote that's funny","date":"2024-10-22","published":"2024-10-22T01:50:55+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>just put together a fun history fact @RacheGabriel <br><br>So Jean Chall&#x27;s (technically my academic grandma) revised Learning to Read the Great Debate (1967) was updated in 1983.<br><br>In 1984 the Council for National Policy did a phonics demo after their keynote<br><br>that&#x27;s funny</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1848542519790821629","display_date":"October 22, 2024 · 01:50 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
