{"id":"twitter:1848336511722283083","tweet_id":"1848336511722283083","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1848336511722283083","title":"I could look at the polls who say everything is tied, and that were wrong in 2022, 2020, 2018, and 2016 or I can look at early voter turn out and mail","summary":"I could look at the polls who say everything is tied, and that were wrong in 2022, 2020, 2018, and 2016 or I can look at early voter turn out and mail in ballot returns. One is what pollsters say people will do, one is what they have done. What is a better predictor?","date":"2024-10-21","published":"2024-10-21T12:12:19+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>I could look at the polls who say everything is tied, and that were wrong in 2022, 2020, 2018, and 2016<br><br>or I can look at early voter turn out and mail in ballot returns.<br><br>One is what pollsters say people will do, one is what they have done.<br><br>What is a better predictor?</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1848336511722283083","display_date":"October 21, 2024 · 12:12 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
