{"id":"twitter:1848026815232659608","tweet_id":"1848026815232659608","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1848026815232659608","title":"The reason Enron Musk chose to focus on Pennsylvania is state election law. PA can't count mail-in ballots until election day. That's why it took four","summary":"The reason Enron Musk chose to focus on Pennsylvania is state election law. PA can't count mail-in ballots until election day. That's why it took four days in 2020. Musk wants to fill the counting period with Mayhem.","date":"2024-10-20","published":"2024-10-20T15:41:42+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>The reason Enron Musk chose to focus on Pennsylvania is state election law.<br><br>PA can&#x27;t count mail-in ballots until election day. That&#x27;s why it took four days in 2020.<br><br>Musk wants to fill the counting period with Mayhem.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1848026815232659608","display_date":"October 20, 2024 · 15:41 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1848026034861412582","tweet_id":"1848026034861412582","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1848026034861412582","title":"@SeesyouS But Enron Musk is stating eligibility to quality for the auction requires you to be \"already\" registered not \"payin\" you for act of registra","summary":"@SeesyouS But Enron Musk is stating eligibility to quality for the auction requires you to be \"already\" registered not \"payin\" you for act of registration. Not saying Rick is wrong, just gaming out what Enron's lawyers would say.","date":"2024-10-20","published":"2024-10-20T15:38:36+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/SeesyouS/status/1848017406997778712","reply_tweet_id":"1848017406997778712","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@SeesyouS But Enron Musk  is stating eligibility to quality for the auction requires you to be &quot;already&quot; registered not &quot;payin&quot; you for act of registration.<br><br>Not saying Rick is wrong, just gaming out what Enron&#x27;s lawyers would say.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1848026034861412582","display_date":"October 20, 2024 · 15:38 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1848024860011676008","tweet_id":"1848024860011676008","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1848024860011676008","title":"The FEC has jurisdiction over enforcing the laws that govern the financing of elections for federal office. Everything else falls to the states. This ","summary":"The FEC has jurisdiction over enforcing the laws that govern the financing of elections for federal office. Everything else falls to the states. This is where Enron Musk can get stuck in a Catch-22. If it isn't about the Federal elections, state election takes precedent.","date":"2024-10-20","published":"2024-10-20T15:33:55+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1848023813553864752","reply_tweet_id":"1848023813553864752","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>The FEC has jurisdiction over enforcing the laws that govern the financing of elections for federal office.<br><br>Everything else falls to the states.<br><br>This is where Enron Musk can get stuck in a Catch-22. If it isn&#x27;t about the Federal elections, state election takes precedent.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1848024860011676008","display_date":"October 20, 2024 · 15:33 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1848023813553864752","tweet_id":"1848023813553864752","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1848023813553864752","title":"The way much of the election law is written you have to establish cause through the FEC before criminal charges. Most campaign finance violations are ","summary":"The way much of the election law is written you have to establish cause through the FEC before criminal charges. Most campaign finance violations are handled as civil rather than criminal cases. The GOP broke the FEC too, and it was slow before that https://x.com/davetroy/status/1847991574384279584","date":"2024-10-20","published":"2024-10-20T15:29:46+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>The way much of the election law is written you have to establish cause through the FEC before criminal charges.<br><br>Most campaign finance violations are handled as civil rather than criminal cases.<br><br>The GOP broke the FEC too, and it was slow before that <a href=\"https://x.com/davetroy/status/1847991574384279584\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://x.com/davetroy/status/1847991574384279584</a></p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1848023813553864752","display_date":"October 20, 2024 · 15:29 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
