{"id":"twitter:1847313808194412626","tweet_id":"1847313808194412626","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1847313808194412626","title":"@WirklichF Just that fresher content will lead to more donations. That is all I don't like muting collections, ever, but if I see the same message cop","summary":"@WirklichF Just that fresher content will lead to more donations. That is all I don't like muting collections, ever, but if I see the same message copy and pasted each day I may start to think it is less credible. That is all. My apologies, and thanks for all you do.","date":"2024-10-18","published":"2024-10-18T16:28:27+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/WirklichF/status/1847313341074559132","reply_tweet_id":"1847313341074559132","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@WirklichF Just that fresher content will lead to more donations. That is all<br><br>I don&#x27;t like muting collections, ever, but if I see the same message copy and pasted each day I may start to think it is less credible.<br><br>That is all. My apologies, and thanks for all you do.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1847313808194412626","display_date":"October 18, 2024 · 16:28 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
