{"id":"twitter:1847027886337020211","tweet_id":"1847027886337020211","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1847027886337020211","title":"@GSarafan @Danger_Rand One of the first shows I ever booked was Gordon Stone Trio in an acoustic room and Disco Biscuits at headliners. Had an issue w","summary":"@GSarafan @Danger_Rand One of the first shows I ever booked was Gordon Stone Trio in an acoustic room and Disco Biscuits at headliners. Had an issue with campus police and couldn't advertise off campus. I think 12 people went. We were all rail riders.","date":"2024-10-17","published":"2024-10-17T21:32:18+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/GSarafan/status/1847021232354382207","reply_tweet_id":"1847021232354382207","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@GSarafan @Danger_Rand One of the first shows I ever booked was Gordon Stone Trio in an acoustic room and Disco Biscuits at headliners.<br><br>Had an issue with campus police and couldn&#x27;t advertise off campus.<br><br>I think 12 people went.<br><br>We were all rail riders.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1847027886337020211","display_date":"October 17, 2024 · 21:32 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1847027392428064822","tweet_id":"1847027392428064822","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1847027392428064822","title":"@GSarafan A positioning technique of crowding notes into beams. While meant to for only eighth notes a bunch more try to squeeze in. This leads to a s","summary":"@GSarafan A positioning technique of crowding notes into beams. While meant to for only eighth notes a bunch more try to squeeze in. This leads to a secondary beam which will constantly interrupt the first rhythmic grouping causing tension which leads feathered beaming and slurs.","date":"2024-10-17","published":"2024-10-17T21:30:21+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/GSarafan/status/1847014040050229733","reply_tweet_id":"1847014040050229733","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@GSarafan A positioning technique of crowding notes into beams. While meant to for only eighth notes a bunch more try to squeeze in. This leads to a secondary beam which will constantly interrupt the first rhythmic grouping causing tension which  leads feathered beaming and slurs.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1847027392428064822","display_date":"October 17, 2024 · 21:30 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
