{"id":"twitter:1846717703660216377","tweet_id":"1846717703660216377","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1846717703660216377","title":"@dberi21 Way past my skillset. Though we did train a model to spot bots on Twitter using a \"ukronazi\" dataset, but we used existing ad tech structures","summary":"@dberi21 Way past my skillset. Though we did train a model to spot bots on Twitter using a \"ukronazi\" dataset, but we used existing ad tech structures. I just did the conceptual work on ideas and let @dromanocpm do the math. We built off a data structure a priori though .","date":"2024-10-17","published":"2024-10-17T00:59:45+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/i/status/1846713781008961987","reply_tweet_id":"1846713781008961987","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@dberi21 Way past my skillset. Though we did train a model to spot bots on Twitter using a &quot;ukronazi&quot; dataset, but we used existing ad tech structures.<br><br>I just did the conceptual work on ideas and let @dromanocpm do the math. We built off a data structure a priori though .</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1846717703660216377","display_date":"October 17, 2024 · 00:59 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
