{"id":"twitter:1846711846973460932","tweet_id":"1846711846973460932","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1846711846973460932","title":"@dberi21 Our multivariate regression Professor made us do matrix algebra by hand. Granted small data dets....but he was all like...you can't understan","summary":"@dberi21 Our multivariate regression Professor made us do matrix algebra by hand. Granted small data dets....but he was all like...you can't understand the math if you don't do it. I like survey design and social network analysis so I do love matrices..just let machines do them","date":"2024-10-17","published":"2024-10-17T00:36:29+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/i/status/1846709384023306640","reply_tweet_id":"1846709384023306640","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@dberi21 Our multivariate regression Professor made us do matrix  algebra by hand.<br><br>Granted small data dets....but he was all like...you can&#x27;t understand the math if you don&#x27;t do it.<br><br>I like survey design and social network analysis so I do love matrices..just let machines do them</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1846711846973460932","display_date":"October 17, 2024 · 00:36 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
