{"id":"twitter:1846658963892228554","tweet_id":"1846658963892228554","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1846658963892228554","title":"@molli89351 @FBI I don't know for sure, but if Elon has access to any cleared data at SpaceX he is 100% subjected to continuous vetting from DCSA. Whi","summary":"@molli89351 @FBI I don't know for sure, but if Elon has access to any cleared data at SpaceX he is 100% subjected to continuous vetting from DCSA. Which means the Government doesn't find him a major threat if he is given access to these assets still.","date":"2024-10-16","published":"2024-10-16T21:06:20+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/molli89351/status/1846658323770449976","reply_tweet_id":"1846658323770449976","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@molli89351 @FBI I don&#x27;t know for sure, but if Elon has access to any cleared data at SpaceX he is 100% subjected to continuous vetting from DCSA.<br><br>Which means the Government doesn&#x27;t find him a major threat if he is given access to these assets still.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1846658963892228554","display_date":"October 16, 2024 · 21:06 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1846658578452828297","tweet_id":"1846658578452828297","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1846658578452828297","title":"@BadGarlandTakes I know, but usually you go for the Capos before the mob boss. We locked up the foot soldiers and they filed charges against the mob b","summary":"@BadGarlandTakes I know, but usually you go for the Capos before the mob boss. We locked up the foot soldiers and they filed charges against the mob boss, but all the Capos left uncharged. It just seems opposite to how most RICO cases are handled. Just wondering on the strategy.","date":"2024-10-16","published":"2024-10-16T21:04:49+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/BadGarlandTakes/status/1846657784621719601","reply_tweet_id":"1846657784621719601","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@BadGarlandTakes I know, but usually you go for the Capos before the mob boss.<br><br>We locked up the foot soldiers and they filed charges against the mob boss, but all the Capos left uncharged.<br><br>It just seems opposite to how most RICO cases are handled.<br><br>Just wondering on the strategy.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1846658578452828297","display_date":"October 16, 2024 · 21:04 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1846658130131787834","tweet_id":"1846658130131787834","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1846658130131787834","title":"@molli89351 @FBI We don't know if the linking to the CISA advisory was blocked on purpose or this hellscape being broken. I am sure Enron Musk undergo","summary":"@molli89351 @FBI We don't know if the linking to the CISA advisory was blocked on purpose or this hellscape being broken. I am sure Enron Musk undergoes continous vetting from DCSA for a variety of work reasons.","date":"2024-10-16","published":"2024-10-16T21:03:02+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/molli89351/status/1846657144957161775","reply_tweet_id":"1846657144957161775","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@molli89351 @FBI We don&#x27;t know if the linking to the CISA advisory was blocked on purpose or this hellscape being broken.<br><br>I am sure Enron Musk undergoes continous vetting from DCSA for a variety of work reasons.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1846658130131787834","display_date":"October 16, 2024 · 21:03 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1846657635447185864","tweet_id":"1846657635447185864","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1846657635447185864","title":"@PreppyProf Is it an LEP class (general Ed)? These kids did miss two years of high school and if it's an LEP they may not want to be there. I have to ","summary":"@PreppyProf Is it an LEP class (general Ed)? These kids did miss two years of high school and if it's an LEP they may not want to be there. I have to work twice as hard an LEP classes to engage students. You do not get into our program late Sophomore year...much culling occured.","date":"2024-10-16","published":"2024-10-16T21:01:04+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/PreppyProf/status/1846656712977084493","reply_tweet_id":"1846656712977084493","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@PreppyProf Is it an LEP class (general Ed)? These kids did miss two years of high school and if it&#x27;s an LEP they may not want to be there.<br><br>I have to work twice as hard an LEP classes to engage students. You do not get into our program late Sophomore year...much culling occured.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1846657635447185864","display_date":"October 16, 2024 · 21:01 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
