{"id":"twitter:1845874554691870738","tweet_id":"1845874554691870738","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1845874554691870738","title":"@BadGarlandTakes In most conspiracy investigations you start at the bottom and use conspirators as chum to catch bigger fish. Garland chose to start w","summary":"@BadGarlandTakes In most conspiracy investigations you start at the bottom and use conspirators as chum to catch bigger fish. Garland chose to start with the Big Whale and leave all the smaller predeators free to bloody the water. That decision confuses people.","date":"2024-10-14","published":"2024-10-14T17:09:23+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1845874089472512306","reply_tweet_id":"1845874089472512306","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@BadGarlandTakes In most conspiracy investigations you start at the bottom and use conspirators as chum to catch bigger fish.<br><br>Garland chose to start with the Big Whale and leave all the smaller predeators free to bloody the water.<br><br>That decision confuses people.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1845874554691870738","display_date":"October 14, 2024 · 17:09 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
