{"id":"twitter:1845827489584603567","tweet_id":"1845827489584603567","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1845827489584603567","title":"@snaggle_fang @NBCNews But I am 100& just trying to ask an inside baseball, cross-tab diver,nerd question. I just noticed @NBCNews using \"Registered v","summary":"@snaggle_fang @NBCNews But I am 100& just trying to ask an inside baseball, cross-tab diver,nerd question. I just noticed @NBCNews using \"Registered voter\" sampling versus \"likely voter\" sampling A math question, I mean nothing more at most. It's not my mode to be mean.","date":"2024-10-14","published":"2024-10-14T14:02:21+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/i/status/1845826829648535627","reply_tweet_id":"1845826829648535627","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@snaggle_fang @NBCNews But I am 100&amp; just trying to ask an inside baseball, cross-tab diver,nerd question.<br><br>I just noticed @NBCNews using &quot;Registered voter&quot; sampling versus &quot;likely voter&quot; sampling<br><br>A math question, I mean nothing more at most. It&#x27;s not my mode to be mean.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1845827489584603567","display_date":"October 14, 2024 · 14:02 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
