{"id":"twitter:1845108204230836349","tweet_id":"1845108204230836349","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1845108204230836349","title":"CMMC, the Cybersecurity Maturity Model Certification is a new federal rule that any Defense contractor who hold government assets not meant for public","summary":"CMMC, the Cybersecurity Maturity Model Certification is a new federal rule that any Defense contractor who hold government assets not meant for public release need a third party assessment to evaluate how well they meet requirements on NIST-SP-800-171 https://t.co/JkACrCSmrR","date":"2024-10-12","published":"2024-10-12T14:24:10+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1845106474264998133","reply_tweet_id":"1845106474264998133","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>CMMC, the Cybersecurity Maturity Model Certification is a new federal rule that any Defense contractor who hold government assets not meant for public release need a third party assessment to evaluate how well they meet requirements on NIST-SP-800-171 <a href=\"https://t.co/JkACrCSmrR\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/JkACrCSmrR</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/4a3e986db78196cd6c7c07ce99123e11.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1845108204230836349","display_date":"October 12, 2024 · 14:24 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/4a3e986db78196cd6c7c07ce99123e11.jpg"]}
