{"id":"twitter:1844473003410956561","tweet_id":"1844473003410956561","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1844473003410956561","title":"@TourneyFrylock @CombatBeat @clearing_fog @brucewilson @Safety @jimstewartson @QAApod I say it because it is clearly an effort of false equivalency to","summary":"@TourneyFrylock @CombatBeat @clearing_fog @brucewilson @Safety @jimstewartson @QAApod I say it because it is clearly an effort of false equivalency to QAnon. Thus the rhyming. Folks want people to make the semiotic link that Blueanon = QAnon And Blueanon 100% came out of Aaron Maté, a known Russian influence agent.","date":"2024-10-10","published":"2024-10-10T20:20:07+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/TourneyFrylock/status/1844471015751274724","reply_tweet_id":"1844471015751274724","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@TourneyFrylock @CombatBeat @clearing_fog @brucewilson @Safety @jimstewartson @QAApod I say it because it is clearly an effort of false equivalency to QAnon.<br><br>Thus the rhyming.<br><br>Folks want people to make the semiotic link that Blueanon = QAnon<br><br>And Blueanon 100% came out of Aaron Maté, a known Russian influence agent.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1844473003410956561","display_date":"October 10, 2024 · 20:20 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
