{"id":"twitter:1844461724587655569","tweet_id":"1844461724587655569","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1844461724587655569","title":"@TourneyFrylock @CombatBeat @clearing_fog @brucewilson @Safety The only time I interacted with Stewartson was when I told him his idea of \"Russian QAn","summary":"@TourneyFrylock @CombatBeat @clearing_fog @brucewilson @Safety The only time I interacted with Stewartson was when I told him his idea of \"Russian QAnon\" about Gay Adoption and Magnitsky that KassandraSeven was talking about was wrong. Adoption ban predated QAnon by five years. interested in Essence of Time and Sergei Kurginyan","date":"2024-10-10","published":"2024-10-10T19:35:18+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/TourneyFrylock/status/1844458012020441406","reply_tweet_id":"1844458012020441406","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@TourneyFrylock @CombatBeat @clearing_fog @brucewilson @Safety The only time I interacted with Stewartson was when I told him his idea of &quot;Russian QAnon&quot; about Gay Adoption and Magnitsky that KassandraSeven was talking about was wrong.<br><br>Adoption ban predated QAnon by five years.<br><br>  interested in Essence of Time and Sergei Kurginyan</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1844461724587655569","display_date":"October 10, 2024 · 19:35 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
