{"id":"twitter:1844457706998071500","tweet_id":"1844457706998071500","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1844457706998071500","title":"@TourneyFrylock @clearing_fog @CombatBeat @brucewilson @Safety Also #BlueAnon is not a thing. We have already reviewed how Aaron Maté the russian trol","summary":"@TourneyFrylock @clearing_fog @CombatBeat @brucewilson @Safety Also #BlueAnon is not a thing. We have already reviewed how Aaron Maté the russian troll made this up. And why does everyone always think I am connected to that Jim guy? I have literally nothing to do with him or Jackie.","date":"2024-10-10","published":"2024-10-10T19:19:20+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/TourneyFrylock/status/1844456557087785378","reply_tweet_id":"1844456557087785378","tags":["BlueAnon"],"body_html":"<p>@TourneyFrylock @clearing_fog @CombatBeat @brucewilson @Safety Also #BlueAnon is not a thing.<br><br>We have already reviewed how Aaron Maté the russian troll made this up.<br><br>And why does everyone always think I am connected to that Jim guy?<br><br>I have literally nothing to do with him or Jackie.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1844457706998071500","display_date":"October 10, 2024 · 19:19 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1844456847526494258","tweet_id":"1844456847526494258","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1844456847526494258","title":"@CombatBeat @TourneyFrylock @clearing_fog @brucewilson @Safety Doesn't interact... NAFO forger alumni...and doing a few fundraisera and have nothing t","summary":"@CombatBeat @TourneyFrylock @clearing_fog @brucewilson @Safety Doesn't interact... NAFO forger alumni...and doing a few fundraisera and have nothing to do with Jackie. I have no idea why they are talking about or who any of those people are. Why not ask me? Who is Amber Rebekah and why my name coming out their mouth?","date":"2024-10-10","published":"2024-10-10T19:15:55+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/CombatBeat/status/1844454735631507471","reply_tweet_id":"1844454735631507471","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@CombatBeat @TourneyFrylock @clearing_fog @brucewilson @Safety Doesn&#x27;t interact... <br><br>   NAFO forger alumni...and doing a few fundraisera<br><br>and have nothing to do with Jackie.<br><br>I have no idea why they are talking about or who any of those people are.<br><br>Why not ask me?<br><br>Who is Amber Rebekah and why my name coming out their mouth?</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1844456847526494258","display_date":"October 10, 2024 · 19:15 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1844453282854601153","tweet_id":"1844453282854601153","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1844453282854601153","title":"@TourneyFrylock @clearing_fog @CombatBeat @brucewilson @Safety How do you get shadow banned for calling Elon's mom a fictional character who kidnapped","summary":"@TourneyFrylock @clearing_fog @CombatBeat @brucewilson @Safety How do you get shadow banned for calling Elon's mom a fictional character who kidnapped 101 Dalmatians? Brigading is against TOS. I don't report to avoid any false accusations of coordination. I only report self harm to meet my legal obligations as a mandated reporter.","date":"2024-10-10","published":"2024-10-10T19:01:45+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/TourneyFrylock/status/1844451947065245842","reply_tweet_id":"1844451947065245842","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@TourneyFrylock @clearing_fog @CombatBeat @brucewilson @Safety How do you get shadow banned for calling Elon&#x27;s mom a fictional character who kidnapped 101 Dalmatians?<br><br>Brigading is against TOS. I don&#x27;t report to avoid any false accusations of coordination.<br><br>I only report self harm to meet my legal obligations as a mandated reporter.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1844453282854601153","display_date":"October 10, 2024 · 19:01 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1844451803947225587","tweet_id":"1844451803947225587","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1844451803947225587","title":"@TourneyFrylock @clearing_fog @CombatBeat @brucewilson @Safety And I go out of my way to avoid your ballgag friends and have nothing to do with that J","summary":"@TourneyFrylock @clearing_fog @CombatBeat @brucewilson @Safety And I go out of my way to avoid your ballgag friends and have nothing to do with that Jim guy you are all hyper focused on. This time I called Elon's mom Cruella de Vil. You have to see the resemblance @Safety, yes? https://t.co/3pjQYbrfDQ","date":"2024-10-10","published":"2024-10-10T18:55:52+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1844451157370077409","reply_tweet_id":"1844451157370077409","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@TourneyFrylock @clearing_fog @CombatBeat @brucewilson @Safety And I go out of my way to avoid your ballgag friends and have nothing to do with that Jim guy you are all hyper focused on.<br><br>This time I called Elon&#x27;s mom Cruella de Vil.<br><br>You have to see the resemblance @Safety, yes? <a href=\"https://t.co/3pjQYbrfDQ\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/3pjQYbrfDQ</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/9caa369acf45e6f7a4e182c572d4d42e.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1844451803947225587","display_date":"October 10, 2024 · 18:55 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/9caa369acf45e6f7a4e182c572d4d42e.jpg"]}
{"id":"twitter:1844451157370077409","tweet_id":"1844451157370077409","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1844451157370077409","title":"@TourneyFrylock @clearing_fog @CombatBeat @brucewilson @Safety I don't report anyone out of fear of getting banned for harassment. ... Unless it's a t","summary":"@TourneyFrylock @clearing_fog @CombatBeat @brucewilson @Safety I don't report anyone out of fear of getting banned for harassment. ... Unless it's a threat or violence or self-harm (I am a state mandated reporter) I will mock you, relentlessly, but not report.","date":"2024-10-10","published":"2024-10-10T18:53:18+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/TourneyFrylock/status/1844450120101921179","reply_tweet_id":"1844450120101921179","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@TourneyFrylock @clearing_fog @CombatBeat @brucewilson @Safety I don&#x27;t report anyone out of fear of getting banned for harassment.<br><br>... Unless it&#x27;s a threat or violence or self-harm (I am a state mandated reporter)<br><br>I will mock you, relentlessly, but not report.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1844451157370077409","display_date":"October 10, 2024 · 18:53 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1844449590843773205","tweet_id":"1844449590843773205","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1844449590843773205","title":"@OneMargaretx @CombatBeat @clearing_fog @brucewilson @Safety I think @x said they were going to beta test a tweet limit for some users. I have never g","summary":"@OneMargaretx @CombatBeat @clearing_fog @brucewilson @Safety I think @x said they were going to beta test a tweet limit for some users. I have never gotten that message. But it is strange this \"glitch\" from @Safety hits the exact same accounts over and over again.","date":"2024-10-10","published":"2024-10-10T18:47:05+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/OneMargaretx/status/1844448081443729649","reply_tweet_id":"1844448081443729649","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@OneMargaretx @CombatBeat @clearing_fog @brucewilson @Safety I think @x said they were going to beta test a tweet limit for some users.<br><br>I have never gotten that message.<br><br>But it is strange this &quot;glitch&quot; from @Safety hits the exact same accounts over and over again.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1844449590843773205","display_date":"October 10, 2024 · 18:47 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1844448383232245808","tweet_id":"1844448383232245808","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1844448383232245808","title":"@gherkinator666 @clearing_fog @CombatBeat @brucewilson @Safety It's such a weird shadowban. It's like @Safety is trying to psychologically wear you do","summary":"@gherkinator666 @clearing_fog @CombatBeat @brucewilson @Safety It's such a weird shadowban. It's like @Safety is trying to psychologically wear you down until you comply with Enron's group think. My professional contacts in #HigherEd and #cybersecurity ask why I block them But I didn't. @premium just wants to harm me reputationally","date":"2024-10-10","published":"2024-10-10T18:42:17+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/gherkinator666/status/1844446910800965957","reply_tweet_id":"1844446910800965957","tags":["HigherEd","cybersecurity"],"body_html":"<p>@gherkinator666 @clearing_fog @CombatBeat @brucewilson @Safety It&#x27;s such a weird shadowban.<br><br>It&#x27;s like @Safety is trying to psychologically wear you down until you comply with Enron&#x27;s group think.<br><br>My professional contacts in #HigherEd and #cybersecurity ask why I block them<br><br>But I didn&#x27;t. @premium just wants to harm me reputationally</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1844448383232245808","display_date":"October 10, 2024 · 18:42 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1844444129364935016","tweet_id":"1844444129364935016","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1844444129364935016","title":"@OneMargaretx @clearing_fog @CombatBeat @brucewilson @Safety It was either calling Enron Musk's mom Cruella de Vil or calling Ted Nugent a pedo. I thi","summary":"@OneMargaretx @clearing_fog @CombatBeat @brucewilson @Safety It was either calling Enron Musk's mom Cruella de Vil or calling Ted Nugent a pedo. I think people know Enron's mom did not kidnap 101 Dalmatians. And Ted Nugent is a verifiable Pedo. Listen to \"Jailbait\" Neither violate TOS","date":"2024-10-10","published":"2024-10-10T18:25:23+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/OneMargaretx/status/1844442538415153256","reply_tweet_id":"1844442538415153256","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@OneMargaretx @clearing_fog @CombatBeat @brucewilson @Safety It was either calling Enron Musk&#x27;s mom  Cruella de Vil or calling Ted Nugent a pedo.<br><br>I think people know Enron&#x27;s mom did not kidnap 101 Dalmatians.<br><br>And Ted Nugent is a verifiable Pedo.<br><br>Listen to &quot;Jailbait&quot;<br><br>Neither violate TOS</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1844444129364935016","display_date":"October 10, 2024 · 18:25 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1844441778143027238","tweet_id":"1844441778143027238","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1844441778143027238","title":"@OneMargaretx @clearing_fog @CombatBeat @brucewilson @Safety Thx. Trying to track who it happens to and why @Safety is doing this to specific users Wh","summary":"@OneMargaretx @clearing_fog @CombatBeat @brucewilson @Safety Thx. Trying to track who it happens to and why @Safety is doing this to specific users What is the pattern?","date":"2024-10-10","published":"2024-10-10T18:16:02+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/OneMargaretx/status/1844440179022627252","reply_tweet_id":"1844440179022627252","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@OneMargaretx @clearing_fog @CombatBeat @brucewilson @Safety Thx. Trying to track who it happens to and why @Safety is doing this to specific users<br><br>What is the pattern?</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1844441778143027238","display_date":"October 10, 2024 · 18:16 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1844441629589213356","tweet_id":"1844441629589213356","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1844441629589213356","title":"@HudsonsHawk91 @CombatBeat @clearing_fog @brucewilson @Safety should feel special @Safety wrote code just to shadowban me and a few others But I am co","summary":"@HudsonsHawk91 @CombatBeat @clearing_fog @brucewilson @Safety should feel special @Safety wrote code just to shadowban me and a few others But I am conducting research on disinformation approved by my University's Institutional Review Board. Hard to do with all the account manipulation. All I did was call Elon's mom Cruella de Vil","date":"2024-10-10","published":"2024-10-10T18:15:27+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/i/status/1844440084030030317","reply_tweet_id":"1844440084030030317","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@HudsonsHawk91 @CombatBeat @clearing_fog @brucewilson @Safety should feel special @Safety wrote code just to shadowban me and a few others<br><br>But I am conducting research on disinformation approved by my University&#x27;s Institutional Review Board.<br><br>Hard to do with all the account manipulation.<br><br>All I did was call Elon&#x27;s mom Cruella de Vil</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1844441629589213356","display_date":"October 10, 2024 · 18:15 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1844440061670293910","tweet_id":"1844440061670293910","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1844440061670293910","title":"@CombatBeat @HudsonsHawk91 @clearing_fog @brucewilson @Safety Best guess it's a very high level shadowban. Or broken shadowbanning code Probably both ","summary":"@CombatBeat @HudsonsHawk91 @clearing_fog @brucewilson @Safety Best guess it's a very high level shadowban. Or broken shadowbanning code Probably both It makes it look like all your tweets were deleted and you block users. Users assume you blocked them @x is trying to cause reputational harm to people who disagree with Elon Musk","date":"2024-10-10","published":"2024-10-10T18:09:13+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/CombatBeat/status/1844439281877794906","reply_tweet_id":"1844439281877794906","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@CombatBeat @HudsonsHawk91 @clearing_fog @brucewilson @Safety Best guess it&#x27;s a very high level shadowban.<br><br>Or broken shadowbanning code<br><br>Probably both<br><br>It makes it look like all your tweets were deleted and you block users.<br><br>Users assume you blocked them<br><br>@x is trying to cause reputational harm to people who disagree with Elon Musk</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1844440061670293910","display_date":"October 10, 2024 · 18:09 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
