{"id":"twitter:2044514843051336018","tweet_id":"2044514843051336018","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=2044514843051336018","title":"In 1989 the FBI interrupted a russian influence campaign through the National Lawyer's Guild https://www.nytimes.com/1989/10/13/nyregion/fbi-admits-bi","summary":"In 1989 the FBI interrupted a russian influence campaign through the National Lawyer's Guild https://www.nytimes.com/1989/10/13/nyregion/fbi-admits-bid-to-disrupt-lawyers-guild.html The case was sealed until 2025 2025 came and went and the FBI still hasn't released any of the files We often never learn the truth https://x.com/ryanmauro/status/204451130310489","date":"2026-04-15","published":"2026-04-15T20:34:58+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>In 1989 the FBI interrupted a russian influence campaign through the National Lawyer&#x27;s Guild<br><br><a href=\"https://www.nytimes.com/1989/10/13/nyregion/fbi-admits-bid-to-disrupt-lawyers-guild.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://www.nytimes.com/1989/10/13/nyregion/fbi-admits-bid-to-disrupt-lawyers-guild.html</a><br><br>The case was sealed until 2025<br><br>2025 came and went and the FBI still hasn&#x27;t released any of the files<br><br>We often never learn the truth <a href=\"https://x.com/ryanmauro/status/2044511303104897176\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://x.com/ryanmauro/status/2044511303104897176</a></p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/2044514843051336018","display_date":"April 15, 2026 · 20:34 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
