{"id":"twitter:2044513575251616079","tweet_id":"2044513575251616079","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=2044513575251616079","title":"@ryanmauro We already know the names behind it. This isn't new, and we hardly get the truth because: -influence isn't illegal in the US -cultivating a","summary":"@ryanmauro We already know the names behind it. This isn't new, and we hardly get the truth because: -influence isn't illegal in the US -cultivating and then protecting assets takes higher priority The FBI has a list, or did, of 600 known russian influencers https://t.co/eV9zgGXZ0j","date":"2026-04-15","published":"2026-04-15T20:29:56+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/ryanmauro/status/2044511303104897176","reply_tweet_id":"2044511303104897176","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@ryanmauro We already know the names behind it.<br><br>This isn&#x27;t new, and we hardly get the truth because:<br>-influence isn&#x27;t illegal in the US<br>-cultivating and then protecting assets takes higher priority<br><br>The FBI has a list, or did, of 600 known russian influencers <a href=\"https://t.co/eV9zgGXZ0j\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/eV9zgGXZ0j</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/9f3df4b4ee55c41cb665fa6b516e3216.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/b221c2f73df9d3c4bfb2fa2560271780.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/2044513575251616079","display_date":"April 15, 2026 · 20:29 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/9f3df4b4ee55c41cb665fa6b516e3216.jpg","/archive/twitter/media/b221c2f73df9d3c4bfb2fa2560271780.jpg"]}
