{"id":"twitter:1843827915471106441","tweet_id":"1843827915471106441","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1843827915471106441","title":"Compliance trolls, yes they are thing, even some who are escaping civil judgements in Peru, have filed complaints about my efforts in Cybersecurity. A","summary":"Compliance trolls, yes they are thing, even some who are escaping civil judgements in Peru, have filed complaints about my efforts in Cybersecurity. Are these related? I dunno you are left guessing. I have to deal with numerous ethical complaints filed by trolls all the time","date":"2024-10-09","published":"2024-10-09T01:36:46+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1843826764960948288","reply_tweet_id":"1843826764960948288","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>Compliance trolls, yes they are thing, even some who are escaping civil judgements in Peru, have filed complaints about my efforts in Cybersecurity.<br><br>Are these related? I dunno you are left guessing.<br><br>I have to deal with numerous ethical complaints filed by trolls all the time</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1843827915471106441","display_date":"October 09, 2024 · 01:36 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1843826764960948288","tweet_id":"1843826764960948288","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1843826764960948288","title":"So much trolling ensued. Then Fox news contacted me? I didn't have tenure yet, two toddles and an infant. Fully admit I was scared. How did I stop it?","summary":"So much trolling ensued. Then Fox news contacted me? I didn't have tenure yet, two toddles and an infant. Fully admit I was scared. How did I stop it? I heaped praise on the student for his political activism. By not fueling the conflict the trolls and press went away,","date":"2024-10-09","published":"2024-10-09T01:32:12+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1843826187124236625","reply_tweet_id":"1843826187124236625","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>So much trolling ensued. Then Fox news contacted me?<br><br>I didn&#x27;t have tenure yet, two toddles and an infant.<br><br>Fully admit I was scared.<br><br>How did I stop it? I heaped praise on the student for his political activism.<br><br>By not fueling the conflict the trolls and press went away,</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1843826764960948288","display_date":"October 09, 2024 · 01:32 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1843826187124236625","tweet_id":"1843826187124236625","source":"twitter","type":"photos","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1843826187124236625","title":"In 2016 when covering Trump, russia, and Ukraine in my classes One of my students was trained to legally record my class (we are a two party state) Th","summary":"In 2016 when covering Trump, russia, and Ukraine in my classes One of my students was trained to legally record my class (we are a two party state) This was then selectively edited and uploaded to alt-right podcasts Am a nobody at a small State school, and they came for me. https://t.co/BI80810sGS","date":"2024-10-09","published":"2024-10-09T01:29:54+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>In 2016 when covering Trump, russia, and Ukraine in my classes<br><br>One of my students was trained  to legally record my class (we are a two party state)<br><br>This was then selectively edited and uploaded to alt-right podcasts<br><br>Am a nobody at a small State school, and they came for me. <a href=\"https://t.co/BI80810sGS\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/BI80810sGS</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/75bbff1ba995d81bc4670cd5e7f108b4.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1843826187124236625","display_date":"October 09, 2024 · 01:29 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/75bbff1ba995d81bc4670cd5e7f108b4.jpg"]}
