{"id":"twitter:1843809068693246454","tweet_id":"1843809068693246454","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1843809068693246454","title":"@alicenotmiller This is kinda why I like #ToonieTuesday Someone else does the lifting on sussing out and the end it's two bucks. The risk is lower, bu","summary":"@alicenotmiller This is kinda why I like #ToonieTuesday Someone else does the lifting on sussing out and the end it's two bucks. The risk is lower, but still can raise tens of thousands of dollars.","date":"2024-10-09","published":"2024-10-09T00:21:52+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1843807714637689244","reply_tweet_id":"1843807714637689244","tags":["ToonieTuesday"],"body_html":"<p>@alicenotmiller This is kinda why I like #ToonieTuesday<br><br>Someone else does the lifting on sussing out and the end it&#x27;s two bucks.<br><br>The risk is lower, but still can raise tens of thousands of dollars.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1843809068693246454","display_date":"October 09, 2024 · 00:21 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1843808643281809841","tweet_id":"1843808643281809841","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1843808643281809841","title":"@alicenotmiller And to me I stay more silent because not to protect bad players, but simply because I know schisms will be attacked by those who have ","summary":"@alicenotmiller And to me I stay more silent because not to protect bad players, but simply because I know schisms will be attacked by those who have long sought to undermine things for whatever reasons. Grifters will grift. And conflict will get exploited","date":"2024-10-09","published":"2024-10-09T00:20:11+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1843807714637689244","reply_tweet_id":"1843807714637689244","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@alicenotmiller And to me I stay more silent because not to protect bad players, but simply because I know schisms will be attacked by those who have long sought to undermine things for whatever reasons.<br><br>Grifters will grift.<br>And conflict will get exploited</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1843808643281809841","display_date":"October 09, 2024 · 00:20 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1843807714637689244","tweet_id":"1843807714637689244","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1843807714637689244","title":"@alicenotmiller Yes for fella requests. I am sure I forged some. I meant either a branded activity like with UA24 or a distribution from store. We cou","summary":"@alicenotmiller Yes for fella requests. I am sure I forged some. I meant either a branded activity like with UA24 or a distribution from store. We could be upset, or know we made free art for the world to enjoy in support of Ukraine. Reducing risk by not curating charities made sense to me","date":"2024-10-09","published":"2024-10-09T00:16:30+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/alicenotmiller/status/1843805348907626975","reply_tweet_id":"1843805348907626975","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@alicenotmiller Yes for fella requests. I am sure I forged some.<br><br>I meant either a branded activity like with UA24 or a distribution from store.<br><br>We could be upset, or  know we made free art for the world to enjoy in support of Ukraine.<br><br>Reducing risk by not curating charities made sense to me</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1843807714637689244","display_date":"October 09, 2024 · 00:16 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
