{"id":"twitter:1843802638305112382","tweet_id":"1843802638305112382","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1843802638305112382","title":"@RachelPAV @WildcardGamez @Official_NAFO @Reiman933 @TheWarSanta It's confusing cuz it's a bunch of brain damaged volunteers who have no idea what's g","summary":"@RachelPAV @WildcardGamez @Official_NAFO @Reiman933 @TheWarSanta It's confusing cuz it's a bunch of brain damaged volunteers who have no idea what's going on. If A fund turns out to be a scam, that sucks, donate to a different one. But that's my personal opinion, everyone do their own do.","date":"2024-10-08","published":"2024-10-08T23:56:19+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/RachelPAV/status/1843801583341187511","reply_tweet_id":"1843801583341187511","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@RachelPAV @WildcardGamez @Official_NAFO @Reiman933 @TheWarSanta It&#x27;s confusing cuz it&#x27;s a bunch of brain damaged volunteers who have no idea what&#x27;s going on.<br><br>If A fund turns out to be a scam, that sucks, donate to a different one.<br><br>But that&#x27;s my personal opinion,  everyone do their own do.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1843802638305112382","display_date":"October 08, 2024 · 23:56 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1843801589431287987","tweet_id":"1843801589431287987","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1843801589431287987","title":"@RachelPAV @WildcardGamez @Official_NAFO @Reiman933 @TheWarSanta A brief history. -All links were on LinkTree, then Elon banned it. -So a website was ","summary":"@RachelPAV @WildcardGamez @Official_NAFO @Reiman933 @TheWarSanta A brief history. -All links were on LinkTree, then Elon banned it. -So a website was made. -Other orgs had slim merch margins and NAFO couldn't get forger designs. So a store was added. -This meant needing legal protection needed for taxes and insurance. That is it.","date":"2024-10-08","published":"2024-10-08T23:52:09+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/RachelPAV/status/1843799142281425138","reply_tweet_id":"1843799142281425138","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@RachelPAV @WildcardGamez @Official_NAFO @Reiman933 @TheWarSanta A brief history.<br>-All links were on LinkTree, then Elon banned it.<br>-So a website was made.<br>-Other orgs had slim merch margins and NAFO couldn&#x27;t get forger designs. So a store was added.<br>-This meant needing legal protection needed for taxes and insurance.<br><br>That is it.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1843801589431287987","display_date":"October 08, 2024 · 23:52 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
