{"id":"twitter:1843744355791909220","tweet_id":"1843744355791909220","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1843744355791909220","title":"So Senator Cardin, on committee held strong. No Magnitsky Act. No repeal of Jackson-Vanik Act. Law passed. Declaring russia terrorist state would have","summary":"So Senator Cardin, on committee held strong. No Magnitsky Act. No repeal of Jackson-Vanik Act. Law passed. Declaring russia terrorist state would have a similar effect of barring trade with EU, China, and India Global collapse","date":"2024-10-08","published":"2024-10-08T20:04:44+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1843743483896705235","reply_tweet_id":"1843743483896705235","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>So Senator Cardin, on  committee held strong.<br><br>No Magnitsky Act. No repeal of Jackson-Vanik Act.<br><br>Law passed.<br><br>Declaring russia  terrorist state would have a similar effect of barring trade with EU, China, and India<br><br>Global collapse</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1843744355791909220","display_date":"October 08, 2024 · 20:04 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1843743483896705235","tweet_id":"1843743483896705235","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1843743483896705235","title":"When Cardin and McCain were trying to pass the Magnitsky Act the Obama administration was dead set against it. Senate used repealing the sanctions as ","summary":"When Cardin and McCain were trying to pass the Magnitsky Act the Obama administration was dead set against it. Senate used repealing the sanctions as a cudgel to force passage of the Magnitsky Act. Kerry, chair of Foreign Relations, did not support the bill. (bc of Obama)","date":"2024-10-08","published":"2024-10-08T20:01:16+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1843742300851359769","reply_tweet_id":"1843742300851359769","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>When Cardin and McCain were trying to pass the Magnitsky Act the Obama administration was dead set against it.<br><br>Senate used repealing the sanctions as a cudgel to force passage of the Magnitsky Act.<br><br>Kerry, chair of Foreign Relations, did not support the bill.<br><br>(bc of Obama)</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1843743483896705235","display_date":"October 08, 2024 · 20:01 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
