{"id":"twitter:1843299755419636152","tweet_id":"1843299755419636152","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1843299755419636152","title":"Elon Musk is violating many laws by making residents of certain states eligible for a referral program but not the residents of other states. The FEC ","summary":"Elon Musk is violating many laws by making residents of certain states eligible for a referral program but not the residents of other states. The FEC will do nothing. Individual states must file charges. https://t.co/iCLAW03P2g","date":"2024-10-07","published":"2024-10-07T14:38:03+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>Elon Musk is violating many laws by making residents of certain states eligible for a referral program but not the residents of other states.<br><br>The FEC will do nothing. Individual states must file charges. <a href=\"https://t.co/iCLAW03P2g\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/iCLAW03P2g</a></p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1843299755419636152","display_date":"October 07, 2024 · 14:38 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
