{"id":"twitter:1843299334739423733","tweet_id":"1843299334739423733","source":"twitter","type":"photos","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1843299334739423733","title":"Only paying people for participating in a referral program is a violation of the law, not just FEC regulations. You can't say some participants in a r","summary":"Only paying people for participating in a referral program is a violation of the law, not just FEC regulations. You can't say some participants in a referral program qualify for a bonus but other participants in different states do not. Why is Elon Musk above the law? https://t.co/H6d9lmJHxL","date":"2024-10-07","published":"2024-10-07T14:36:22+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>Only paying people for participating in a referral program is a violation of the law, not just FEC regulations.<br><br>You can&#x27;t say some participants in a referral program qualify for a bonus but other participants in different states do not.<br><br>Why is Elon Musk above the law? <a href=\"https://t.co/H6d9lmJHxL\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://t.co/H6d9lmJHxL</a></p><figure><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/archive/twitter/media/15c6d1f344baf8be0511388329d8a4ba.jpg\" alt=\"Photo attached to archived tweet\"></figure>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1843299334739423733","display_date":"October 07, 2024 · 14:36 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":["/archive/twitter/media/15c6d1f344baf8be0511388329d8a4ba.jpg"]}
