{"id":"twitter:1843298425238106617","tweet_id":"1843298425238106617","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1843298425238106617","title":"@mhsheikh @Lastdance_LL We don't know if Elon is out of scope any data not meant for public release. If that is true, that is good news. Based on what","summary":"@mhsheikh @Lastdance_LL We don't know if Elon is out of scope any data not meant for public release. If that is true, that is good news. Based on what he self-reports in terms of Starlink network topology I think Elon does have access to controlled or possibly classified assets.","date":"2024-10-07","published":"2024-10-07T14:32:46+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/i/status/1843297608703635929","reply_tweet_id":"1843297608703635929","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@mhsheikh @Lastdance_LL We don&#x27;t know if Elon is out of scope any data not meant for public release.<br><br>If that is true, that is good news.<br><br>Based on what he self-reports in terms of Starlink network topology I think Elon does have access to controlled or possibly classified assets.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1843298425238106617","display_date":"October 07, 2024 · 14:32 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
