{"id":"twitter:1843294911044722837","tweet_id":"1843294911044722837","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1843294911044722837","title":"Access to Federal Systems and protecting confidentiality of those assets would require meeting security requirements as laid out in NIST-SP-800-53. Th","summary":"Access to Federal Systems and protecting confidentiality of those assets would require meeting security requirements as laid out in NIST-SP-800-53. This would be explained in the DD 254 that SpacX signs. Free Speech has nothing to do with internal risk assessments. https://x.com/Lastdance_LL/status/1843293975387746558","date":"2024-10-07","published":"2024-10-07T14:18:48+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>Access to Federal Systems and protecting confidentiality of those assets would require meeting security requirements as laid out in NIST-SP-800-53.<br><br>This would be explained in the DD 254 that SpacX signs.<br><br>Free Speech has nothing to do with internal risk assessments. <a href=\"https://x.com/Lastdance_LL/status/1843293975387746558\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://x.com/Lastdance_LL/status/1843293975387746558</a></p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1843294911044722837","display_date":"October 07, 2024 · 14:18 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
{"id":"twitter:1843294406520287416","tweet_id":"1843294406520287416","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1843294406520287416","title":"@Lastdance_LL So you admit some Ex Federal employees have to get their writing approved. Now Elon's authorized access may or may not require clearance","summary":"@Lastdance_LL So you admit some Ex Federal employees have to get their writing approved. Now Elon's authorized access may or may not require clearance and continuous vetting by DCSA His access to federal and non-federal systems would be governed by FISMA. Isn't a free speech issue at all.","date":"2024-10-07","published":"2024-10-07T14:16:47+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/Lastdance_LL/status/1843293677978001545","reply_tweet_id":"1843293677978001545","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@Lastdance_LL So you admit some Ex Federal employees have to get their writing approved.<br><br>Now Elon&#x27;s authorized access may or may not require clearance and continuous vetting by DCSA<br><br>His access to federal and non-federal systems would be governed by FISMA.<br><br>Isn&#x27;t a free speech issue at all.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1843294406520287416","display_date":"October 07, 2024 · 14:16 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
