{"id":"twitter:1841644051428262289","tweet_id":"1841644051428262289","source":"twitter","type":"notes","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1841644051428262289","title":"Censorship is Free Speech on Private Property You never, ever have any Free Speech rights between you and a corporation. Ever That is either a contrac","summary":"Censorship is Free Speech on Private Property You never, ever have any Free Speech rights between you and a corporation. Ever That is either a contractual issue, with Terms of Service, or a libel issue with defamation It is never a Fee Speech Issue #ShadyVance knows that https://x.com/Iraqveteran8888/status/1841641645013443040","date":"2024-10-03","published":"2024-10-03T00:58:52+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":null,"reply_tweet_id":"","tags":["ShadyVance"],"body_html":"<p>Censorship is Free Speech on Private Property<br><br>You never, ever have any Free Speech rights between you and a corporation.<br><br>Ever<br><br>That is either a contractual issue, with Terms of Service, or a libel issue with defamation<br><br>It is never a Fee Speech Issue<br><br>#ShadyVance knows that <a href=\"https://x.com/Iraqveteran8888/status/1841641645013443040\" rel=\"noreferrer\">https://x.com/Iraqveteran8888/status/1841641645013443040</a></p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1841644051428262289","display_date":"October 03, 2024 · 00:58 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
