{"id":"twitter:2088438232354832448","tweet_id":"2088438232354832448","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=2088438232354832448","title":"@FoyRees @lindsay7bsky I have no problem with a registered NGO or non-profit paying staff. Overhead is overhead and G+A costs are real. But for \"volun","summary":"@FoyRees @lindsay7bsky I have no problem with a registered NGO or non-profit paying staff. Overhead is overhead and G+A costs are real. But for \"volunteers\" to seek donations for living expenses... This creates a potential for conflict of interest at a level where I look elsewhere to donate.","date":"2026-08-15","published":"2026-08-15T01:30:50+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/FoyRees/status/2088395956169408965","reply_tweet_id":"2088395956169408965","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@FoyRees @lindsay7bsky I have no problem with a registered NGO or non-profit paying staff.<br><br>Overhead is overhead and G+A costs are real.<br><br>But for &quot;volunteers&quot; to seek donations for living expenses... This creates a potential for conflict of interest at a level where I look elsewhere to donate.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/2088438232354832448","display_date":"August 15, 2026 · 01:30 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
