{"id":"twitter:1840879896916344879","tweet_id":"1840879896916344879","source":"twitter","type":"replies","url":"/archive/twitter/?id=1840879896916344879","title":"@Olliekay4 @ManbearOG @YourAnonCentral @AP I made a mistake this is trained on our \"ukronazi\" dataset. We have datasets for \"Burisma\" and \"multipolar\"","summary":"@Olliekay4 @ManbearOG @YourAnonCentral @AP I made a mistake this is trained on our \"ukronazi\" dataset. We have datasets for \"Burisma\" and \"multipolar\" as well. Haven't published a study yet. Want to do replicate the model on multiple data sets. Problem is you can only use historical data with no API.","date":"2024-09-30","published":"2024-09-30T22:22:23+00:00","author":"Greg McVerry","reply_to":"https://twitter.com/Olliekay4/status/1840878883136004242","reply_tweet_id":"1840878883136004242","tags":[],"body_html":"<p>@Olliekay4 @ManbearOG @YourAnonCentral @AP I made a mistake this is trained on our &quot;ukronazi&quot; dataset.<br><br>We have datasets for &quot;Burisma&quot; and &quot;multipolar&quot; as well.<br><br>Haven&#x27;t published a study yet.<br><br>Want to do replicate the model on multiple data sets.<br><br>Problem is you can only use historical data with no API.</p>","original_url":"https://twitter.com/jgmac1106/status/1840879896916344879","display_date":"September 30, 2024 · 22:22 UTC","access":"PUBLIC","publish_status":"published","is_retweet":false,"photos":[]}
